%% Mermaid flowchart. Docs: https://mermaid.js.org/syntax/flowchart.html
%% Used in the document with \lkdiagram{diagrams/pipeline}
flowchart TD
  A[<<vi:Dữ liệu||en:Data>>] --> B[<<vi:Tiền xử lý||en:Preprocess>>]
